    // ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    //  SMC_Orderblock_Detector_Filter_cBot
    //
    //  ── ENTRY TRIGGER ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  Detection logic taken verbatim from order_block_detector_cbot_single.cs.
    //  FVG detection added from Order-Block Detector.cs (indicator).
    //  Both OB and FVG triggers are independently toggled.
    //  OB takes priority when both fire on the same bar.
    //
    //  ── SMC FILTER ENGINE ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  A self-contained embedded copy of the OB detection engine from
    //  SMC_orderblock_detector.cs (no indicator reference).
    //  Maintains live pools of UNMITIGATED (unbroken) Internal and Swing OBs.
    //  An OB remains in the pool from the moment it is created (by a structure
    //  break) until price fully mitigates it (HighLow mode: High > ob.Top for
    //  bear OBs, Low < ob.Bottom for bull OBs).
    //  Three independent filters — any combination can be enabled:
    //
    //  Filter 1 – Internal OB:
    //    Long  allowed only when at least one ACTIVE (unmitigated) bullish
    //           Internal OB was touched by any of the last Filter1Lookback bars.
    //    Short allowed only when at least one ACTIVE bearish  Internal OB was
    //           touched by any of the last Filter1Lookback bars.
    //    "Touched" = a bar's Low ≤ ob.Top (bull) or High ≥ ob.Bottom (bear).
    //
    //  Filter 2 – Swing OB:
    //    Same as Filter 1 but applied to the Swing OB pool.
    //
    //  Filter 3 – Internal OR Swing OB:
    //    Long  allowed when EITHER a bullish Internal OR a bullish Swing OB
    //           was touched within the last Filter3Lookback bars.
    //    Short allowed when EITHER a bearish  Internal OR a bearish  Swing OB
    //           was touched within the last Filter3Lookback bars.
    //
    //  KEY DESIGN — unmitigated = unbroken:
    //    OBs are NEVER consumed on first touch.  They stay in the pool as long
    //    as they are unbroken.  The filter scans the CURRENT active pool and
    //    checks whether any of the last N closed bars touched any OB still in it.
    //    This means even a touch that happened many bars ago is valid, provided
    //    the OB has NOT been mitigated since then.
    //
    //  Disabled filters always pass (trade is allowed regardless).
    //  All active filters must pass simultaneously for a trade to fire.
    //
    //  ── TRADE RULES ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  SL = lowest low / highest high over StopLossLookbackBars before signal.
    //  TP = SL distance × RiskRewardRatio.
    //  Volume = Balance × RiskPercent% / (SL pips × PipValue).
    // ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

